'''Sanosuke Sagara''' (相楽左之助, ''Sagara Sanosuke'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sanosuke Sagara
|image = E 689.png
|first appearance = [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a high-pierce midranger whose [[Omni Strike]] can snipe even the likes of [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]. His damage/DPS is on the lower side, however, and he isn't especially tanky. Sanosuke's knockback count also works against him, giving him neither good survivability nor resilience.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with Sanosuke depends on what stage of the game you're in. In early-midgame, you're better off outranging him with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to slowly secure the kill. Later on, you can abuse his rather long attack-cooldown and low damage to burst him down with rushers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], and Awakened Bahamut Cat.

